  "prefLabel": "He-M 1007.05 Approval",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 1007.05 Approval.\n\n(a) A provider shall approve a completed application for a HSG if:\n\n(1) The eligibility requirements in He-M 1007.03 are met;\n\n(2) The application contains all elements required pursuant to He-M 1007.04 (b); and\n\n(3) There exists no reason for denial pursuant to He-M 1007.06(a).\n\n(b) Within 5 business days after an approval for a HSG application, the provider shall issue to the landlord a HSG certificate with the value of the HSG.\n\n(c) Each provider shall notify the department monthly of all new HSG application approvals.\n\nSource. #9579, eff 10-24-09, EXPIRED: 10-24-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-m1000.html"
